WEBVTT

00:00:12.717 --> 00:00:15.511
Whoa! Whoa, okay! Okay, all right.

00:00:15.665 --> 00:00:17.095
That's enough of the magic show.

00:00:17.250 --> 00:00:18.472
MINIONS: Aw!

00:00:19.432 --> 00:00:20.516
(GASPS)

00:00:20.671 --> 00:00:22.378
Wait, did you hear that?

00:00:22.787 --> 00:00:26.412
It sounded like the twinkling
sounds of magical fairy dust.

00:00:26.509 --> 00:00:28.611
(GASPS) It's the fairy princess!
She's coming!

00:00:28.705 --> 00:00:30.007
(ALL GASP)

00:00:30.061 --> 00:00:31.152
(GASPS) Look!

00:00:38.075 --> 00:00:39.410
(GRUNTING)

00:00:40.077 --> 00:00:41.996
Huh? Oh! (CHUCKLES)
Eh? (BLOWS RASPBERRY)

00:00:42.830 --> 00:00:43.873
(CHUCKLING)
(GRUNTING)

00:00:44.321 --> 00:00:47.460
(YELLS) Ow!

00:00:47.543 --> 00:00:48.759
(GRUNTING)

00:00:49.003 --> 00:00:50.838
-KID: Ow.
-(GROANS)

00:00:53.132 --> 00:00:54.217
(GRUNTING)

00:00:56.844 --> 00:00:58.262
(GASPS AND SIGHS)

00:00:58.387 --> 00:01:02.183
(IN HIGH-PITCHED VOICE)
It is I, Gruzinkerbell,

00:01:02.660 --> 00:01:06.812
the most magical fairy princess of all!

00:01:07.089 --> 00:01:11.025
And I am here to wish Princess Agnes

00:01:11.344 --> 00:01:13.486
a very happy birthday!

00:01:13.893 --> 00:01:15.188
How come you're so fat?

00:01:16.223 --> 00:01:17.510
Because

00:01:18.145 --> 00:01:20.073
my house is made of candy,

00:01:20.366 --> 00:01:24.538
and sometimes I eat
instead of facing my problems!

00:01:24.622 --> 00:01:26.754
How come you have... (COUGHING)

00:01:27.250 --> 00:01:28.918
Okay, time for cake.

00:01:29.126 --> 00:01:30.253
ALL: Yay!

00:01:31.671 --> 00:01:33.089
(GROANS)

00:01:33.827 --> 00:01:37.051
Thank you, Gruzinkerbell!
You're the best fairy princess ever!

00:01:37.378 --> 00:01:39.676
(IN HIGH-PITCHED VOICE)
You are welcome, little girl!

00:01:42.329 --> 00:01:45.879
I know it's really you, Gru.
I'm just pretending for the other kids.

00:01:51.065 --> 00:01:54.277
Hey there, Gru.
Mr. Life of the Party! (LAUGHS)

00:01:54.485 --> 00:01:55.820
Hello, Jillian.

00:01:55.987 --> 00:01:59.156
So, I'm gonna go out on a limb here,

00:01:59.215 --> 00:02:05.288
but my friend Natalie is
recently single, and... Oop.

00:02:05.343 --> 00:02:08.124
No, no, no,
get off the limb right now. No limb.

00:02:08.352 --> 00:02:10.394
(LAUGHS) Come on, she's a riot!

00:02:10.668 --> 00:02:13.629
She sings karaoke, she has a
lot of free time,

00:02:13.718 --> 00:02:16.590
looks aren't that important to her...

00:02:16.617 --> 00:02:20.508
No, Jills, that is not happening.
Seriously, I'm fine.

00:02:20.761 --> 00:02:23.272
Okay, fine, forget Natalie.
How about my cousin Linda?

00:02:23.306 --> 00:02:24.332
No!

00:02:24.347 --> 00:02:26.904
Oh! Oh! I know someone whose
husband just died...

00:02:27.310 --> 00:02:28.519
(YELLS)

00:02:28.644 --> 00:02:29.645
(GASPS)

00:02:29.960 --> 00:02:32.013
I'm sorry, I did not see you there.

00:02:32.815 --> 00:02:33.816
(YELLS)

00:02:34.219 --> 00:02:35.651
Or there.

00:02:35.776 --> 00:02:37.028
(CHUCKLES)

00:02:45.745 --> 00:02:47.621
GRU: Kyle? Kyle?

00:02:48.070 --> 00:02:51.069
Kyle, no!
Do not do your business on the petunias!

00:02:52.987 --> 00:02:55.281
There you go. Those are Fred's, go crazy.

00:02:59.186 --> 00:03:00.188
Good boy!

00:03:01.165 --> 00:03:03.034
LUCY: Mr. Gru?
-(STAMMERING) I didn't... What? Yes?

00:03:05.412 --> 00:03:07.972
Hi! Agent Lucy Wilde of the AVL.

00:03:08.866 --> 00:03:11.284
Oh, (CHUCKLES) whoops! (CLEARS THROAT)

00:03:11.629 --> 00:03:13.488
Sorry, you're gonna have to come with me.

00:03:14.212 --> 00:03:16.817
Oh, sorry, I... Freeze ray!

00:03:20.638 --> 00:03:24.135
You know, you really should announce
your weapons after you fire them, Mr. Gru.

00:03:25.058 --> 00:03:26.118
For example...

00:03:29.129 --> 00:03:30.842
Lipstick taser!

00:03:32.072 --> 00:03:33.489
Oh, it works so good.

00:03:34.710 --> 00:03:36.045
(GRUNTS)

00:03:42.920 --> 00:03:44.553
Man!

00:03:45.513 --> 00:03:47.708
Large person.

00:03:53.319 --> 00:03:56.190
(GRUNTS)
Oh, sorry.

00:03:58.192 --> 00:03:59.235
(GRUNTING WITH EFFORT)

00:03:59.781 --> 00:04:01.959
-Get in there...
-Huh?

00:04:02.605 --> 00:04:05.074
...you big man!

00:04:10.996 --> 00:04:12.066
Boss!

00:04:15.793 --> 00:04:16.836
(CHATTERING IN MINIONESE)

00:04:16.919 --> 00:04:18.170
(CHATTERING IN MINIONESE)

00:04:22.508 --> 00:04:23.634
(GRUNTS)

00:04:26.011 --> 00:04:27.054
Uh? Huh!

00:04:30.057 --> 00:04:31.475
(SCREAMING)

00:04:31.809 --> 00:04:33.269
Whoa!

00:04:34.728 --> 00:04:35.813
Huh?

00:04:35.896 --> 00:04:37.731
Ah! Whoo!

00:04:38.274 --> 00:04:39.817
Ooh!

00:04:39.984 --> 00:04:41.360
(YELLING)

00:04:56.667 --> 00:04:57.710
(EXCLAIMING IN MINIONESE)

00:04:59.422 --> 00:05:00.563
Oh!

00:05:02.158 --> 00:05:03.228
Huh? Ah. Quack, quack!

00:05:03.252 --> 00:05:04.467
(DUCK QUACKING)
(YELLING)

00:05:10.097 --> 00:05:11.265
(YELLING)

00:05:13.476 --> 00:05:14.727
(BOTH YELLING)

00:05:14.852 --> 00:05:16.103
(BOTH GRUNT)

00:05:16.270 --> 00:05:17.313
(BOTH EXCLAIM AGGRESSIVELY)

00:05:25.821 --> 00:05:27.823
(PEDESTRIANS EXCLAIMING IN ALARM)

00:05:54.600 --> 00:05:55.643
(HIP HOP MUSIC PLAYING)

00:05:55.768 --> 00:05:56.810
(CHANGING RADIO STATIONS)

00:06:14.828 --> 00:06:16.455
MINIONS: Wow!

00:06:16.580 --> 00:06:18.040
(HONKING HORN)

00:06:19.250 --> 00:06:20.709
(BOTH SCREAM)

